{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23756","headline":"和汴州令狐相公新於郡内栽竹百竿拆壁开轩旦夕对翫偶题七言五韵 · 白居易","name":"和汴州令狐相公新於郡内栽竹百竿拆壁开轩旦夕对翫偶题七言五韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梁园修竹旧传名，园废年深竹不生。\n千亩荒凉寻未得，百竿青翠种新成。\n墙开乍见重添兴，窗静时闻别有情。\n烟叶蒙笼侵夜色，风枝萧飒欲秋声。\n更登楼望尤堪重，千万人家无一茎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23756.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23756","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}